{"seq":2,"slug":"data-lineage-and-observability","title":"数据血缘与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/data-lineage-and-observability","wordCount":1836,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据血缘与可观测性\">数据血缘与可观测性</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>数据血缘与可观测性是数据平台从&quot;能用&quot;到&quot;可信、可控&quot;的关键跨越。数据血缘回答&quot;数据从哪来，到哪去，经过了什么变换&quot;；数据可观测性回答&quot;数据管道现在健康吗，哪里出了问题&quot;。两者共同构成了数据平台的&quot;全链路透视&quot;能力。</p>\n<p>在拥有数千条管道和数万张表的数据平台中，缺乏血缘和可观测性意味着：一次上游变更可能悄无声息地破坏下游数百个报表；一条管道的静默失败可能数天后才被业务方发现；数据问题的根因定位可能需要数小时甚至数天的人工排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>血缘与可观测性共同构成数据平台的「全链路透视」能力，二者关注不同但互补的问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据血缘</strong>回答「数据从哪来、到哪去、经过了什么变换」——它是一张有向图，节点是数据实体（表、列、任务），边是数据流转关系，用于影响分析和根因追溯</li>\n<li><strong>数据可观测性</strong>回答「数据管道现在健康吗、哪里出了问题」——借鉴 SRE 理念，关注新鲜度、数据量、Schema、分布和血缘五项指标</li>\n</ul>\n<p>血缘是「结构」，可观测性是「状态」：没有血缘，告警无法定位影响范围；没有可观测性，血缘只是一张静态地图。二者结合才能把「某张表异常」快速转化为「哪些下游报表受影响、根因在哪个上游管道」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据血缘基础\">数据血缘基础</h2><h3 id=\"血缘图模型\">血缘图模型</h3><p>数据血缘本质上是一个有向图，节点代表数据实体（表、列、任务），边代表数据流转关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源表A.col1] --&gt; C[转换任务T1]&#10;    B[源表B.col2] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[目标表C.col3]&#10;    D --&gt; E[下游报表]&#10;    D --&gt; F[下游 ML 特征]\">graph LR\n    A[源表A.col1] --&gt; C[转换任务T1]\n    B[源表B.col2] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[目标表C.col3]\n    D --&gt; E[下游报表]\n    D --&gt; F[下游 ML 特征]</pre><p>图的粒度层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>边含义</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据集级</td>\n<td>表/Topic/文件</td>\n<td>&quot;产出&quot;</td>\n<td>影响分析概览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列级</td>\n<td>列/字段</td>\n<td>&quot;派生自&quot;</td>\n<td>精确影响分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务级</td>\n<td>ETL/查询</td>\n<td>&quot;读取/写入&quot;</td>\n<td>管道依赖管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行级</td>\n<td>行/记录</td>\n<td>&quot;源自&quot;</td>\n<td>审计合规</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"列级血缘\">列级血缘</h3><p>列级血缘追踪每一列的数据来源，是影响分析中最有价值的粒度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 示例：目标表 mart.user_summary&#10;CREATE TABLE mart.user_summary AS&#10;SELECT&#10;  u.user_id,                              -- ← raw.users.user_id&#10;  u.name,                                  -- ← raw.users.name&#10;  COUNT(o.order_id) AS order_count,        -- ← raw.orders.order_id (聚合)&#10;  SUM(o.amount) AS total_spend             -- ← raw.orders.amount (聚合)&#10;FROM raw.users u&#10;JOIN raw.orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;GROUP BY u.user_id, u.name;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 示例：目标表 mart.user_summary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.user_summary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ← raw.users.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ← raw.users.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ← raw.orders.order_id (聚合)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spend             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ← raw.orders.amount (聚合)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>列级血缘揭示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>mart.user_summary.total_spend</code> 派生自 <code>raw.orders.amount</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>raw.orders.amount</code> 的类型从 INT 变为 DECIMAL，直接影响 <code>total_spend</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"血缘采集方法\">血缘采集方法</h3><p><strong>静态分析法</strong>——解析 SQL/代码的 AST 提取血缘：</p>\n<p>优点：不需要运行作业，覆盖所有代码路径缺点：无法处理动态 SQL、UDF 内部逻辑</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# sqlglot 列级血缘解析示例&#10;import sqlglot&#10;from sqlglot.lineage import lineage&#10;&#10;# 解析 SQL 获取列级血缘&#10;result = lineage(&#10;    &quot;total_spend&quot;,&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    SELECT user_id, SUM(amount) AS total_spend&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;,&#10;    schema={&quot;orders&quot;: {&quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;VARCHAR&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: &quot;DECIMAL&quot;}}&#10;)&#10;# result: orders.amount → total_spend\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># sqlglot 列级血缘解析示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlglot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlglot.lineage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解析 SQL 获取列级血缘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"total_spend\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id, SUM(amount) AS total_spend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VARCHAR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DECIMAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># result: orders.amount → total_spend</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行时采集法</strong>——从引擎执行日志或 Hook 中捕获实际血缘：</p>\n<p>优点：反映真实执行路径，包含动态逻辑缺点：只能捕获已执行的路径，需要引擎支持</p>\n<p><strong>混合法</strong>——静态分析为基础，运行时补充动态部分（推荐实践）</p>\n<h3 id=\"血缘存储\">血缘存储</h3><p>血缘图的存储和查询需要专用的图存储或索引：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图数据库</strong>（Neo4j）：原生图存储，复杂图遍历性能优秀</li>\n<li><strong>关系型 + 递归查询</strong>：PostgreSQL 的 WITH RECURSIVE，适合中小规模</li>\n<li><strong>专用血缘服务</strong>：OpenLineage 标准 + Marquez 后端</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据可观测性\">数据可观测性</h2><h3 id=\"可观测性的五大支柱\">可观测性的五大支柱</h3><p>借鉴 SRE 的可观测性理念，数据可观测性关注：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>新鲜度（Freshness）</strong>：表最后更新时间与预期的偏差</li>\n<li><strong>数据量（Volume）</strong>：行数和字节数的波动</li>\n<li><strong>Schema</strong>：结构变更是否在预期内</li>\n<li><strong>分布（Distribution）</strong>：值的统计分布是否异常</li>\n<li><strong>血缘（Lineage）</strong>：上下游关系是否发生变化</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"监控指标体系\">监控指标体系</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 数据可观测性指标定义&#10;metrics:&#10;  freshness:&#10;    table: mart.daily_revenue&#10;    expected_update: &#39;每天 06:00 前&#39;&#10;    alert_threshold: &#39;延迟 &gt; 2h&#39;&#10;&#10;  volume:&#10;    table: staging.events&#10;    baseline: &#39;7天移动平均&#39;&#10;    alert_threshold: &#39;偏差 &gt; 30%&#39;&#10;&#10;  distribution:&#10;    table: mart.orders&#10;    column: amount&#10;    checks:&#10;      - &#39;mean 偏差 &lt; 20%&#39;&#10;      - &#39;null 比例 &lt; 0.1%&#39;&#10;      - &#39;max &lt; 1,000,000&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据可观测性指标定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mart.daily_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    expected_update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每天 06:00 前'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    alert_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'延迟 > 2h'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  volume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">staging.events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    baseline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7天移动平均'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    alert_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'偏差 > 30%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mart.orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    checks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mean 偏差 &#x3C; 20%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'null 比例 &#x3C; 0.1%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'max &#x3C; 1,000,000'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据-sla\">数据 SLA</h3><p>为每个关键数据产品定义 SLA：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SLA 维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时效性 SLA</td>\n<td>数据在 T+N 小时内可用</td>\n<td>监控表的 <code>updated_at</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性 SLA</td>\n<td>缺失率 &lt; X%</td>\n<td>定期完整性扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性 SLA</td>\n<td>月度可查询时间 &gt; 99.9%</td>\n<td>健康检查探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性 SLA</td>\n<td>对账误差 &lt; X%</td>\n<td>周期性对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"openlineage-标准\">OpenLineage 标准</h2><p>OpenLineage 是一个开放的血缘元数据标准，定义了事件驱动的血缘上报协议：</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件模型\">事件模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;eventType&quot;: &quot;COMPLETE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;eventTime&quot;: &quot;2024-01-15T03:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;run&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;runId&quot;: &quot;run-uuid-123&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;job&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;production&quot;,&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;daily_user_metrics&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;inputs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;production&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;staging.events&quot;,&#10;      &quot;facets&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;schema&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;fields&quot;: [&#10;            { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;user_id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;VARCHAR&quot; },&#10;            { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;event_type&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;VARCHAR&quot; }&#10;          ]&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;outputs&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;production&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;mart.user_metrics&quot;,&#10;      &quot;facets&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;columnLineage&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;fields&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;active_days&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;inputFields&quot;: [{ &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;production&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;staging.events&quot;, &quot;field&quot;: &quot;event_date&quot; }]&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"