          { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VARCHAR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mart.user_metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"facets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"columnLineage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"active_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"inputFields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"staging.events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"event_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"生态集成\">生态集成</h3><p>支持 OpenLineage 的工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>引擎</strong>：Spark（OpenLineage Spark Agent）、Flink、dbt</li>\n<li><strong>编排器</strong>：Airflow（Lineage Backend）、Dagster</li>\n<li><strong>后端</strong>：Marquez、Atlan、DataHub</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"告警与响应\">告警与响应</h2><h3 id=\"告警策略\">告警策略</h3><p>分级告警避免告警疲劳：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P0（紧急）</strong>：关键报表 SLA 违约，影响业务决策</li>\n<li><strong>P1（高）</strong>：重要管道失败，N 小时内需修复</li>\n<li><strong>P2（中）</strong>：数据质量轻微下降，需排查</li>\n<li><strong>P3（低）</strong>：统计异常但不影响业务，周级处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"告警富化\">告警富化</h3><p>告警不应只是&quot;表 X 异常&quot;，还应包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>受影响的下游表和报表列表（通过血缘图计算）</li>\n<li>可能的根因候选（通过上游血缘追溯）</li>\n<li>历史相似事件的处理方案</li>\n<li>数据所有者和 On-call 联系方式</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"根因分析\">根因分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"异常告警：mart.daily_revenue 行数下降 50%&#10;  ↓ 血缘上溯&#10;staging.orders 行数正常&#10;staging.payments 今日为空&#10;  ↓ 进一步上溯&#10;source.payment_service CDC 管道 3:00 开始失败&#10;  ↓ 根因&#10;上游支付服务数据库连接池满，CDC 超时\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>异常告警：mart.daily_revenue 行数下降 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ 血缘上溯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>staging.orders 行数正常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>staging.payments 今日为空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ 进一步上溯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.payment_service CDC 管道 3:00 开始失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ 根因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>上游支付服务数据库连接池满，CDC 超时</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可观测性平台架构\">可观测性平台架构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"数据源层              采集层              存储层            消费层&#10;┌─────────┐     ┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐&#10;│ Spark   │────→│ OL Agent    │───→│ Marquez  │───→│ 告警引擎 │&#10;│ Flink   │────→│ Metadata    │    │ /DataHub │    │ Dashboard│&#10;│ Airflow │────→│ Collector   │    │          │    │ API      │&#10;│ dbt     │────→│             │    │ ┌──────┐ │    └──────────┘&#10;└─────────┘     └─────────────┘    │ │Graph │ │&#10;                                    │ │Store │ │&#10;                                    │ └──────┘ │&#10;                                    └──────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>数据源层              采集层              存储层            消费层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────┐     ┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Spark   │────→│ OL Agent    │───→│ Marquez  │───→│ 告警引擎 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Flink   │────→│ Metadata    │    │ /DataHub │    │ Dashboard│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ Airflow │────→│ Collector   │    │          │    │ API      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ dbt     │────→│             │    │ ┌──────┐ │    └──────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────┘     └─────────────┘    │ │Graph │ │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    │ │Store │ │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    │ └──────┘ │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    └──────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实施路径\">实施路径</h2><h3 id=\"第一阶段-基础血缘\">第一阶段：基础血缘</h3><ol>\n<li>部署 Marquez 或 DataHub 作为血缘后端</li>\n<li>为 Spark/Airflow 启用 OpenLineage 集成</li>\n<li>实现表级血缘的自动采集</li>\n<li>构建基础的影响分析 UI</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"第二阶段-可观测性监控\">第二阶段：可观测性监控</h3><ol>\n<li>部署新鲜度和数据量监控</li>\n<li>建立关键表的 SLA 定义</li>\n<li>配置分级告警策略</li>\n<li>集成到 On-call 轮值流程</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"第三阶段-高级能力\">第三阶段：高级能力</h3><ol>\n<li>实现列级血缘采集</li>\n<li>引入统计异常检测</li>\n<li>建立自动化根因分析</li>\n<li>构建数据健康评分体系</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>先覆盖关键路径</strong>：优先对业务最核心的数据管道建立完整的血缘和监控</li>\n<li><strong>自动化优先</strong>：血缘采集必须自动化，手工维护的血缘信息会迅速过期</li>\n<li><strong>统一标准</strong>：采用 OpenLineage 等开放标准，避免被特定工具锁定</li>\n<li><strong>上下文丰富</strong>：告警需要包含足够的上下文信息，减少人工排查时间</li>\n<li><strong>持续校准</strong>：定期验证血缘数据的准确性，清理陈旧的血缘关系</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据血缘与可观测性是数据平台从「能用」跨越到「可信、可控」的关键。血缘以有向图描述数据流转，粒度从数据集级、列级、任务级到行级——列级在影响分析中价值最高，采集方式则是静态 SQL 解析、运行时日志和 Hook 拦截的混合。可观测性借鉴 SRE 理念，用新鲜度、数据量、Schema、分布和血缘五大支柱持续监控管道健康。</p>\n<p>两者结合的价值在根因分析中体现得最充分：一个行数下降的告警，配合血缘上溯，可以自动推导出「受影响的下游报表列表」和「可能的根因候选」，把数小时的人工排查压缩到分钟级。OpenLineage 作为开放标准，让血缘上报不再被特定引擎或工具锁定。</p>\n<p>落地建议遵循三段路径：先为基础血缘（表级采集 + 影响分析 UI），再建可观测性监控（新鲜度、数据量、SLA、分级告警），最后推进列级血缘、统计异常检测与自动化根因分析。始终记住自动化优先——手工维护的血缘信息会迅速过期。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据血缘与可观测性","id":"数据血缘与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据血缘基础","id":"数据血缘基础"},{"level":3,"text":"血缘图模型","id":"血缘图模型"},{"level":3,"text":"列级血缘","id":"列级血缘"},{"level":3,"text":"血缘采集方法","id":"血缘采集方法"},{"level":3,"text":"血缘存储","id":"血缘存储"},{"level":2,"text":"数据可观测性","id":"数据可观测性"},{"level":3,"text":"可观测性的五大支柱","id":"可观测性的五大支柱"},{"level":3,"text":"监控指标体系","id":"监控指标体系"},{"level":3,"text":"数据 SLA","id":"数据-sla"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenLineage 标准","id":"openlineage-标准"},{"level":3,"text":"事件模型","id":"事件模型"},{"level":3,"text":"生态集成","id":"生态集成"},{"level":2,"text":"告警与响应","id":"告警与响应"},{"level":3,"text":"告警策略","id":"告警策略"},{"level":3,"text":"告警富化","id":"告警富化"},{"level":3,"text":"根因分析","id":"根因分析"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性平台架构","id":"可观测性平台架构"},{"level":2,"text":"实施路径","id":"实施路径"},{"level":3,"text":"第一阶段：基础血缘","id":"第一阶段-基础血缘"},{"level":3,"text":"第二阶段：可观测性监控","id":"第二阶段-可观测性监控"},{"level":3,"text":"第三阶段：高级能力","id":"第三阶段-高级能力"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据质量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/data-quality-engineering"},"next":{"title":"成本优化与弹性伸缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/cost-optimization-and-scaling"}}